{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22428","headline":"感情 · 白居易","name":"感情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中庭晒服玩，忽见故乡履。\n昔赠我者谁，东邻婵娟子。\n因思赠时语，特用结终始。\n永愿如履綦，双行复双止。\n自吾谪江郡，漂荡三千里。\n爲感长情人，提携同到此。\n今朝一惆怅，反覆看未已。\n人只履犹双，何曾得相似。\n可嗟复可惜，锦表绣爲里。\n况经梅雨来，色黯花草死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}